          "events":[{"type":"talk","target_id":"npc:atai","options":["repair_plan"]}],
          "effects":[{"type":"dialogue","character_id":"npc:atai","lines":["先让环上的光照回幼根，再接起枝桥。不要把光只引向你们那边。"]},{"type":"dialogue","character_id":"npc:ruanheng","lines":["同意。本地根台恢复后，再检查东岸支路接口，确认两边没有继续互相抽取。"]},{"type":"character_memory","character_id":"npc:ruanheng","memory":"opening:local_repair_partner"}]
        },
        {
